WEBVTT

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:15.360
"I can't overcome it"  "I'm annoyed"

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.100
Even if I break down those hurdles

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:28.310
No answer emerges

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:34.810
Am I being controlled?  Everyone on the field

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:39.750
Isn't scared, go away, but...

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.450
The unseen road to the future

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:51.200
Cannot be chosen

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.500
Close your eyes and cut with your heart

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.160
just like cards, surely

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.230
It was promised  yes!  you are the winner

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.100
never lose!  Cut with your heart

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.330
just like cards, surely

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:16.680
Because a miracle will occur

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:28.600
Slifer the Sky Dragon

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:46.380
Nightmare's Steelcage prevents us from attacking for two turns.

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:47.940
This is bad.

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:52.390
He'll create Slime Tokens for two turns so that he can Tribute them.

00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:58.900
Yes.  Even if there's no Battle Phase, I can still summon Slimes.

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:01.600
He's very confident.

00:02:01.910 --> 00:02:04.640
He must already have a God Card in his hand.

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:07.140
He's going to summon Slifer!

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:13.380
While you're inside that cage, watch me summon Slifer the Sky Dragon.

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:18.540
Domino City's A Block, check complete.

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:21.310
No sign of a God Card.

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:24.340
Nothing in B Block.

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:26.220
Nothing in C Block.

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:28.110
Nothing in D Block.

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:29.970
Nothing in E Block.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:31.740
Seto.

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:36.770
You haven't found the God Cards or the Ghouls' Rare Hunters?

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:38.360
Not yet.

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:40.270
We haven't detected them.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:43.800
They're in the city somewhere.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:48.740
Since they're after Obelisk the Tormentor, they'll eventually come to me.

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:52.290
But I won't let them make the first move.  I'll go after them!

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:56.290
Contact me when you find them.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:57.080
Yes, sir!

00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:01.120
Sounds like they haven't caught those rats yet.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:06.300
They can't avoid Kaiba Corporation's surveillance network.

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:14.310
They don't realize they're being trapped from the skies.

00:03:16.030 --> 00:03:20.050
I created this tournament to trap them.

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:25.780
Ghouls, I will get the remaining two God Cards.

00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:27.530
Let's go, Mokuba.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.130
It's your turn.

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:41.280
But you can't do anything inside the cage.

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:47.400
How does it feel to be trapped inside a cage and losing your freedom?

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:50.350
Do you feel humiliated?  Or hopeless?

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:56.510
Burdened with destiny, that's how the tombkeepers and I felt!

00:03:57.050 --> 00:04:00.560
What did I do to Marik's family?

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:07.160
Pharaoh, when I get my revenge, I will finally be free.

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:10.030
And I will become the new Pharaoh!

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:15.450
I'm the Pharaoh, but I don't remember any of it.

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:20.200
That's why I can't afford to lose.

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:23.220
For everyone waiting for me...

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:29.320
For my friend who I promised to duel when he becomes a true duelist...

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.450
To protect my partner's life...

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:40.330
And in order to regain my memories!

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:42.330
I must not lose!

00:04:43.770 --> 00:04:44.830
I end my turn.

00:04:46.670 --> 00:04:49.590
It's finally time.  My turn!

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:57.510
He has enough Tributes.

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:06.220
Behold!  Here comes God!

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:06.680
Slifer is here!

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:15.180
So this is Slifer the Sky Dragon!

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:23.190
Correct.  This is Slifer the Sky Dragon, one of the three God Cards.

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:31.120
This cage isn't the only reason why I can't move.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:36.710
Slifer's intense aura is paralyzing me.  I've never felt anything like this before!

00:06:37.060 --> 00:06:41.510
Is there any way to defeat this earth-shaking divine beast?

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:42.530
No!

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:45.660
There is no way to defeat Slifer.

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:50.970
All duelists are powerless before Slifer's unlimited power.

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:53.720
Even you, Pharaoh!

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:55.730
Unlimited power?

00:06:56.200 --> 00:07:01.730
Slifer the Sky Dragon's attack points are equal to the number of cards in my hand multiplied by 1000.

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:07.470
I have two cards in my hand, so it has 2000 attack points.

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:10.710
Your hand determines its attack points?

00:07:11.020 --> 00:07:12.880
So watch this.

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:15.210
The spell card Pot of Greed.

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:18.210
I now have one card in my hand.

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:23.720
But Pot of Greed let me draw two cards from my deck.

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:26.480
So I have two more cards in my hand.

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:30.200
That means Slifer has 3000 attack points!

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:35.470
And it'll rise to 4000 next turn.

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:40.770
In Duel Monsters, you can only have six cards in your hand during the End Phase.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:45.980
So the most attack points that Slifer can have during my turn is 6000.

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:48.350
6000 at most?

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:50.920
How naive.

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:53.520
I said it had unlimited power.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:58.490
I have a card in my hand that will raise its attack points.

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:02.800
A Continuous Spell that lets me have unlimited cards in my hand.

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:09.260
And Slifer the Sky Dragon has a terrifying effect.

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:16.350
The cage will vanish at the end of your next turn.

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:20.280
That's when Slifer will attack you.

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:24.780
It's your turn!

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:29.500
Slifer has 3000 attack points.

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:37.290
My Buster Blader gains 500 attack points for every Dragon on his field.

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:41.300
So Buster Blader has 3100 attack points.

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:45.310
If it attacks now, it can destroy Slifer.

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:49.810
But this cage won't let me attack this turn.

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:56.310
When he draws next turn, Slifer will gain 1000 attack points.

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:57.660
What's wrong?

00:08:57.660 --> 00:09:01.630
Can't draw a card because you're frozen in fear?

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:04.730
Dammit!  What should I do?

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:12.360
The cage stops your Battle Phase, but you can still set cards or summon monsters.

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:15.680
You can still try to fight back.

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:22.840
I'll watch you writhe in agony inside that cage.

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:27.110
I won't lose!

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:28.250
I draw!

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:30.750
I'll never give up.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:36.750
I know my hand has a way to defeat Slifer the Sky Dragon.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:38.640
Think!

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:43.600
Yes.  Think.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:51.560
The more you think, the more you'll realize that you cannot win.

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:56.000
His next turn will be our showdown!

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:59.160
I set two cards.

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:03.250
And I summon Kuriboh in defense position.

00:10:04.440 --> 00:10:05.750
I end my turn.

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:08.750
The cage finally vanishes.

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:13.250
The cage that was protecting you.

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:44.000
My turn!

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:45.510
I draw!

00:10:45.510 --> 00:10:48.620
Slifer gains 1000 attack points.

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:58.080
Here I go!  Slifer attacks!

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:01.260
The super electric wave, Thunder Force!

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:06.180
I flip over my set card!

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:07.180
What?

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:09.180
Lightforce Sword!

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:14.350
It seals one card in your hand on to the field!

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:21.590
Slifer's attack points decrease to 3000.

00:11:21.860 --> 00:11:28.040
Buster Blader avoids Slifer's attack and retaliates with its Dragon Sword!

00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:32.270
Good.  I can destroy Slifer.

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:39.250
Did you forget?

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:44.980
As long as I have the Continuous Trap Jam Defender, you can't destroy my monsters.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:52.000
I now activate a Continuous Spell Card.

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:55.830
Card of Safe Return?

00:11:55.830 --> 00:12:03.160
Yes.  Whenever a monster resurrects, I'm allowed to draw three cards from my deck.

00:12:03.550 --> 00:12:06.110
So I have five cards in my hand.

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:10.670
Slifer the Sky Dragon's attack points rise to 5000!

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.380
5000 attack points!

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:20.170
Why won't you duel?

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:21.880
Just duel anybody!

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:25.520
Get it over with and advance to the finals!

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:26.890
I can't do that.

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:32.700
I can't just duel anybody for such an important battle.

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:34.970
Stop trying to be cool!

00:12:34.970 --> 00:12:38.540
Only a limited number of duelists can enter the finals.

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:41.900
If you waste time, someone will take your place!

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:44.640
I promised Yugi.

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:53.430
That I'll keep winning in Battle City, become a true duelist and duel him in the finals.

00:12:55.200 --> 00:13:01.230
To become a true duelist, I must duel someone stronger than me.

00:13:01.230 --> 00:13:07.660
Great!  I'm proud that you'd want to duel someone stronger than yourself to hone your skills.

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:10.670
But Honda is right too.

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:14.710
If you don't make the finals, then it was all for nothing-

00:13:18.670 --> 00:13:19.680
Kaiba!

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:24.160
Why is this nobody wearing a Duel Disk?

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:25.400
Why?

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:27.180
Because I'm a duelist.

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:30.690
I thought you were only Level 2.

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:32.730
Well, whatever.

00:13:32.730 --> 00:13:34.000
Let's go, Mokuba.

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:40.090
Honda, I finally found my opponent.

00:13:40.350 --> 00:13:42.700
You're actually thinking of dueling Kaiba?

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:45.700
Kaiba!  Duel me!

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:49.570
Seriously?

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:51.210
Are you serious, Jonouchi?

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:56.140
I'll show you what a nobody can do!

00:13:57.180 --> 00:13:59.000
Get off your high horse.

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:01.960
You're not ready to challenge my brother-

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:02.760
Fine.

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:08.560
That's the spirit.

00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:10.950
Big brother...

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:14.160
I'll show you a God.

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:19.320
Here I go, Kaiba!

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:23.610
What?

00:14:24.490 --> 00:14:25.610
It's unbearable!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.210
Big brother!

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:35.110
Mr. Seto, we found the location of a Rare Hunter with a God Card!

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:36.750
Please get on board!

00:14:38.260 --> 00:14:40.720
Damn!  What's with that helicopter?

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:44.220
I'm calling off the duel!

00:14:45.810 --> 00:14:46.730
What?

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:50.230
How lucky.  You escaped your death.

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.500
What, punk?

00:14:52.710 --> 00:14:54.840
Hey!  Come back!

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:57.290
Coward!

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:02.980
Aww, he ran away from me.

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:04.400
Say what?

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:05.460
We know you're relieved.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:06.350
Gulp!

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:15.190
He's dueling at Point West 350.

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:20.560
The duelist facing the Rare Hunter is... Yugi Muto!

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:21.460
Yugi!

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:25.760
I'm the one who will battle you!

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:37.240
Buster Blader is destroyed!

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:46.100
Do you now realize that there's no way to defeat a God?

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:50.120
Slifer is invincible because it gains attack points for every card in my hand.

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:53.340
And this God hasn't shown its full power yet.

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:58.540
On your next turn, Slifer will show you its terrifying hidden ability!

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:01.140
It's your turn.

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:08.140
I have Kuriboh in defense position and one set card.

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:12.650
And I don't have any cards in my hand that will turn the tables.

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:17.470
So it all depends on the top card in my deck.

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:20.150
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:23.770
Magic Cylinder.

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:27.160
This card unleashes its power when I combo it with a Magician.

00:16:28.540 --> 00:16:32.940
Dark Magician Girl, only you can use this card!

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:34.670
Here I go!

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:37.550
I tribute Kuriboh.

00:16:37.770 --> 00:16:41.580
I summon Dark Magician Girl in defense position!

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:46.910
You summoned a new monster.

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:49.920
So Slifer's effect activates.

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:51.320
What?

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:59.180
Slifer's other mouth opened!

00:17:00.130 --> 00:17:06.470
When you summon a monster on your turn, Slifer deals it 2000 points of damage.

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:11.820
Checking attack points if it's in attack position, defense points if it's in defense position:

00:17:11.820 --> 00:17:14.470
If it's 2000 or less, your monster is destroyed.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:18.480
What?  Dark Magician Girl has 1700 defense points.

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:20.210
Lightning Bullet!

00:17:23.340 --> 00:17:26.520
His monster can attack during my turn!

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:28.270
This is no monster.

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:29.020
It's a God!

00:17:30.180 --> 00:17:31.990
I flip over my set card!

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:38.000
That little girl didn't live long.

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:40.500
Are you sure?

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:41.720
What?

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:45.410
The spell card Magical Hats!

00:17:46.720 --> 00:17:48.410
You hid her in a hat?

00:17:48.410 --> 00:17:53.140
Sorry but Slifer destroyed the wrong hat.

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:55.800
Well, keep trying your best.

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:57.570
Even though it's pointless.

00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:03.820
I'll keep fighting as long as I have a sliver of life left!

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:06.900
I set two cards.

00:18:07.970 --> 00:18:09.220
I end my turn.

00:18:10.720 --> 00:18:14.520
You hid set cards under your three Magical Hats.

00:18:14.520 --> 00:18:16.470
My turn!  I draw!

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:19.470
I have six cards in my hand.

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:23.330
According to the rules, I can't hold additional cards.

00:18:23.550 --> 00:18:24.480
But!

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:28.480
If I use this card, I can hold as many cards as I want.

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:30.980
The Continuous Spell Infinite Cards!

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:33.130
Infinite Cards?

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:35.990
Do you know what this means?

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:39.840
Slifer's attack points can rise forever!

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:41.840
It's my Battle Phase!

00:18:41.840 --> 00:18:43.560
The Sky Dragon attacks!

00:18:43.560 --> 00:18:45.160
Thunder Force!

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:47.380
Shoot the hat on the right!

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:53.440
He shot the correct one.

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:56.510
I have excellent instincts.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:00.780
This is my final shot!

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:07.080
Along with Magical Hats, Dark Magician Girl is destroyed!

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:07.790
What?

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:12.650
Magic Cylinder absorbs Slifer's attack!

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:19.400
I hid two other cards in the same hat with Dark Magician Girl.

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:23.200
Magic Cylinder and Spellbinding Circle!

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:29.420
Magic Cylinder shoots Slifer's Thunder Force back!

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:34.050
Will that destroy a God?

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:35.420
Pointless.

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:39.050
I told you that you can't defeat a God.

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:45.790
Even if I reflect back an attack, the slime blocks it!

00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:50.230
Revival Jam has reformed.

00:19:50.230 --> 00:19:55.800
Due to Card of Safe Return, I now draw three cards.

00:19:56.050 --> 00:19:59.350
Slifer gains 3000 attack points.

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:02.500
And the Draw Phase gives it 1000 more points.

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:06.110
8300 attack points!

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:10.020
Spellbinding Circle won't work on a God.

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:13.870
All spell effects vanish after one turn.

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:26.500
Look.

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:31.420
These five cards form the ultimate combo, God Five!

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:33.670
Flawless and invincible.

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:36.900
This God formation is unbeatable!

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:46.570
I can't win.

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:51.470
There's no way to defeat Slifer.

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:53.940
Get up, Yugi!

00:20:57.400 --> 00:21:00.000
A duelist like you won't lose here!

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:01.500
Kaiba!

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:05.180
I consider you a proud duelist.

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:09.330
You are not allowed to lose pathetically in front of me!

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:16.600
I know you can see our endless road!

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:19.020
You're going to stop here?

00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:27.530
If a God stands in your way, knock God down!

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:47.690
Due to the ultimate combo God Five, Slifer the Sky Dragon doesn't take any attacks.

00:21:47.690 --> 00:21:51.760
Gaining attack points every turn, it now has over 10,000.

00:21:52.030 --> 00:21:55.830
Even Yugi can't turn the tables-

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:58.330
What?  You found a way?

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:01.860
An infinite combo that's greater than the ultimate combo?

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:05.930
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Surpass God!
Ultimate Infinite Loop

00:22:05.930 --> 00:22:07.460
Duel, standby!

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:25.700
Even a long, long time ago

00:22:26.490 --> 00:22:31.070
I feel like I've been here

00:22:31.590 --> 00:22:40.720
The setting sun colors the classroom after school

00:22:41.030 --> 00:22:52.260
We all laugh as you point out that I cut my bangs too short

00:22:55.120 --> 00:22:59.770
Time passes bit by bit

00:23:00.420 --> 00:23:05.040
The time when my bangs touch my eyelids

00:23:05.590 --> 00:23:10.140
Will never change

00:23:10.800 --> 00:23:15.420
The sunset envelops everyone

00:23:16.040 --> 00:23:20.620
To be who I am

00:23:21.210 --> 00:23:25.860
I've kept searching for something

00:23:26.510 --> 00:23:30.560
The time that we're now spending together

00:23:30.560 --> 00:23:33.500
I learned that's the answer

00:23:34.290 --> 00:23:40.610
From now until forever...
